{"seq":77,"slug":"language-interop-ffi","title":"编程语言互操作与FFI","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi","rating":{"composite":3.61,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"编程语言互操作与ffi\">编程语言互操作与FFI</h1><p>现实世界的软件系统很少只用一种语言写成。一个典型的后端服务可能用 Rust 写性能敏感的核心引擎，用 Python 做数据处理管道，用 Java 承载企业级业务逻辑，再用 TypeScript 构建前端界面。这些语言之间如何安全、高效地交换数据与调用函数，正是本 hub 要系统回答的问题。</p>\n<p>本 hub 聚焦四条递进主线。第一章「FFI基础原理」建立所有跨语言互操作的理论地基——调用约定决定了函数参数如何传递，内存模型与所有权规则决定了谁负责释放资源，类型编组决定了数据在两种语言间如何翻译。这三个概念贯穿后续所有章节，理解它们是看懂具体语言 FFI 实现的前提。</p>\n<p>第二章「主流语言FFI实践」选取三种最具代表性的生态做实战剖析。Rust 代表了系统级语言如何以安全为核心设计 FFI，Python 代表了动态语言如何通过 C 扩展获得性能，Java 则展示了从 JNI 到 Panama 的演进路径——从手写原生方法绑定到声明式外部函数接口。每一种模式都有其适用场景和工程权衡。</p>\n<p>第三章「WASM与组件模型」探讨一种全新的互操作范式。WebAssembly 不再仅仅是浏览器中的加速技术，它正在成为通用的跨语言互操作层。线性内存模型、WASI 预览版 2、组件模型与 WIT 接口定义语言——这些技术合在一起，正在定义「一次编译，到处安全互操作」的未来。</p>\n<p>第四章「多语言系统架构」将视角从单个 FFI 调用提升到整个系统层面。多语言微服务如何通过 gRPC 和 Thrift 通信？绑定生成工具如何自动化数千行样板代码？多语言项目的构建、测试、调试又面临哪些独特挑战？这些是任何超过一种语言的真实项目迟早要面对的工程问题。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：至少熟悉两种编程语言（最好一种编译型、一种解释型），理解栈与堆的区别、指针与引用的概念、函数调用的基本机制。不需要汇编语言基础，但能读懂 C 语言函数签名会有帮助。</p>\n<p><strong>学习路径建议</strong>：如果你是第一次接触 FFI，按顺序通读四章——从原理到实践再到架构。如果你带着具体问题来（比如「我要给 Python 写 Rust 扩展」），可以先读第一章建立基础，再跳到第二章对应语言的章节，最后回来看第四章的工程化建议。WASM 相关内容可独立阅读，但建议先掌握第一章的内存模型概念。</p>\n<p><strong>与兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：本 hub 专注于「语言之间如何互操作」的原理与实践。各语言自身的语法与特性请参考对应语言 hub；分布式系统通信协议的深层原理在分布式系统 hub；容器与编排层面的多语言部署在云原生 hub。本 hub 覆盖的是从函数调用级别到系统架构级别的跨语言桥接技术栈。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ffi-foundations","title":"FFI基础原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/ffi-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"calling-conventions-abi","title":"调用约定与ABI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/ffi-foundations/calling-conventions-abi"},{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-ownership-crossing","title":"内存模型与所有权跨语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/ffi-foundations/memory-ownership-crossing"},{"seq":3,"slug":"type-marshalling","title":"类型映射与编组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/ffi-foundations/type-marshalling"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"mainstream-ffi-practice","title":"主流语言FFI实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/mainstream-ffi-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rust-c-cpp-interop","title":"Rust/C/C++互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/mainstream-ffi-practice/rust-c-cpp-interop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"python-c-api-extensions","title":"Python扩展与C API","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/mainstream-ffi-practice/python-c-api-extensions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"java-jni-panama","title":"Java/JNI与Panama","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/mainstream-ffi-practice/java-jni-panama"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"wasm-component-model","title":"WASM与组件模型","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/wasm-component-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wasm-interop-principles","title":"WebAssembly互操作原理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/wasm-component-model/wasm-interop-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"wasm-component-model","title":"WASM组件模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/wasm-component-model/wasm-component-model"},{"seq":3,"slug":"browser-runtime-integration","title":"浏览器与运行时集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/wasm-component-model/browser-runtime-integration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"polyglot-systems","title":"多语言系统架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/polyglot-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"polyglot-microservices","title":"多语言微服务通信","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/polyglot-systems/polyglot-microservices"},{"seq":2,"slug":"binding-generation-tools","title":"语言绑定生成工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/polyglot-systems/binding-generation-tools"},{"seq":3,"slug":"polyglot-project-engineering","title":"多语言项目工程化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/language-interop-ffi/polyglot-systems/polyglot-project-engineering"}]}]}